15
00:01:49.292 --> 00:01:49.708
[groaning]

16
00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.271
[breathing heavily and fearfully]

17
00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:01.188
[whirring]

18
00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:06.625
[whirring]

19
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:07.750
[whirring stops]

20
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:15.710
[alarm continues beeping]

21
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:24.042
[wistful music playing]

22
00:02:47.936 --> 00:02:50.042
[Hunginn whirring to life]

23
00:03:48.042 --> 00:03:52.938
GUARD
